## Third-party components

This licence covers the ForgeLM code, the synthetic dataset generated by it,
and the trained LoRA adapter weights in `artifacts/`.

It does NOT cover the base model. The adapter is useless on its own and must be
loaded on top of:

    Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct
    revision 7ae557604adf67be50417f59c2c2f167def9a775
    licence: apache-2.0

The base model's own licence governs its use. No base-model weights are
redistributed in this repository.
